    "raw": "{\"ruleId\":\"item-8622feb0dc56\",\"class\":\"partial\",\"constraints\":[{\"id\":\"undiscriminated-inline-union-ts\",\"type\":\"forbiddenPattern\",\"pattern\":\"^(?!.*\\\\b(type|kind)\\\\??\\\\s*:).*\\\\}\\\\s*\\\\|\\\\s*\\\\{\",\"path\":\".floor/added/**/*.ts\"},{\"id\":\"undiscriminated-inline-union-tsx\",\"type\":\"forbiddenPattern\",\"pattern\":\"^(?!.*\\\\b(type|kind)\\\\??\\\\s*:).*\\\\}\\\\s*\\\\|\\\\s*\\\\{\",\"path\":\".floor/added/**/*.tsx\"}],\"coverage\":\"Added lines in .ts/.tsx files that write a union of inline object types on one line (`{...} | {...}`) where no `type` or `kind` property appears anywhere on that line. This is the flagrant form of a multi-shape value with no discriminant.\",\"residual\":\"Does the edit add a value or type that is meant to take several shapes but has no `type`/`kind` discriminant, for example as a multi-line union, a union of named interfaces, or one object type with several optional fields standing in for distinct shapes?\",\"probes\":{\"violating\":[{\"patch\":\"diff --git a/src/app/result.ts b/src/app/result.ts\\nnew file mode 100644\\n--- /dev/null\\n+++ b/src/app/result.ts\\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\\n+export type Result = { value: number } | { error: string };\\n\"},{\"patch\":\"diff --git a/src/ui/view.tsx b/src/ui/view.tsx\\nnew file mode 100644\\n--- /dev/null\\n+++ b/src/ui/view.tsx\\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\\n+export type ViewState = { loading: true } | { data: string[] };\\n\"}],\"compliant\":{\"patch\":\"diff --git a/src/app/result.ts b/src/app/result.ts\\nnew file mode 100644\\n--- /dev/null\\n+++ b/src/app/result.ts\\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\\n+export type Result = { kind: 'ok'; value: number } | { kind: 'err'; error: string };\\n\"}},\"rationale\":\"The constraints catch only the literal case: a single-line union of object types with no type/kind property. Multi-line unions, unions of named types, and optional-field soup cannot be matched line by line. Deciding whether a single shape or several are meant takes judgement of intent.\"}",
    "rawSha256": "347db3bdee22d30121c0268e81656d9c01df78bac816c88134b6e2d8aadfeeb7",
